Derived from Gemmini (C++ models of its Chisel hardware, with comments citing its source):
  include/systolique/arith.h, config.h, types.h, pe.h, tile.h, mesh.h, transposer.h,
  tag_queue.h, mesh_with_delays.h
  src/config.cpp, types.cpp, pe.cpp, tile.cpp, mesh.cpp, transposer.cpp, tag_queue.cpp,
  mesh_with_delays.cpp
  bench/stimulus.cpp, bench/reference.cpp (request sequences as Gemmini's ExecuteController
  issues them)
  docs/microarchitecture.md (description of Gemmini's microarchitecture)
  include/systolique/fe_util.h, frontend_config.h, isa.h, scratchpad.h, execute_controller.h,
  reservation_station.h, loop_matmul.h, command_path.h, controller.h, engine.h
  src/frontend_config.cpp, isa.cpp, scratchpad.cpp, execute_controller.cpp,
  reservation_station.cpp, loop_matmul.cpp, command_path.cpp, controller.cpp
  src/engine.cpp (matmul command streams as gemmini.h of gemmini-rocc-tests 1a1a1c6 issues them)
  include/systolique/host.h, src/host.cpp (decode Gemmini's mvin / mvout / config encodings)
  bench/fe_stimulus.cpp (command sequences as gemmini.h and LoopMatmul issue them)
  docs/micro_ops.md (description of Gemmini's controllers)

Generated from Gemmini or built on it:
  rtl/src/GemminiTops.scala (wrappers instantiating Gemmini's Mesh and MeshWithDelays),
  rtl/build.sbt, rtl/elaborate.sh (compile Gemmini's unmodified sources)
  rtl/ex/src/ExecuteTop.scala, CmdTop.scala, CtrlTop.scala (wrappers instantiating Gemmini's
  ExecuteController, scratchpad and accumulator banks, LoopConv, LoopMatmul, ReservationStation),
  rtl/ex/src/MidasTargetutils.scala, rtl/ex/build.sbt, rtl/ex/elaborate_ex.sh
  tests/reference/gemmini_rtl/, tests/reference/gemmini_fe/ (input/output traces of RTL
  elaborated from Gemmini's sources)

Gemmini's own sources and the generated Verilog are not included.

